      "evidence_quote": "An Exact Generate - Transform Decomposition of Small-LLM Team Scaling Across Orchestration Architectures. Authors: Blaz Bertalanic, Carolina Fortuna.",
      "confidence": 0.9
    },
    {
      "claim": "The decomposition diagnoses each task, showing that arithmetic offers coverage headroom that a critic-guided transform converts, while multiple-choice benchmarks either saturate in coverage or fail to convert it.",
      "source_id": "dd7d50d292e98a7c",
      "evidence_quote": "The decomposition diagnoses each task: arithmetic offers coverage headroom that a critic-guided transform converts, whereas the multiple-choice benchmarks either saturate in coverage or fail to convert it, and on open-ended code generative recovery nearly vanishes so accuracy tracks coverage.",
      "confidence": 0.8
    },
    {
      "claim": "Across six frontier and open models, none recovers the exact set of conditions in more than 10% of interactive cases.",
      "source_id": "35f37f152c05e59c",
